  "lifetime": "Choice may retain the prior copied drawing while the active search owns a new one; candidate cells borrow current. The full Approach helper returns only copied view values before its original cold token is released. Confirmation formula deliberately counts four caller/command copy images plus the entire reserved cold arena, including potential overlap already inside that arena; it is a conservative additive view payload census. Existing Draft history/Overlay/Session budgets are not reclaimed. Raw position rebuild count does not bound native engine/GPU deferred lifetime, capacity slack, String/Dictionary/Callable/WeakRef allocation or driver work."
